      "duration": 4320,
      "offset": 422800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "engineers at Harvard found a moth stuck",
      "duration": 4960,
      "offset": 424400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "in the relay of the Mark 2 computer.",
      "duration": 4160,
      "offset": 427120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "They taped it into the log book with one",
      "duration": 4559,
      "offset": 429360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "note. First actual case of bug being",
      "duration": 5600,
      "offset": 431280,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "found. The term debugging stuck. In",
      "duration": 5761,
      "offset": 433919,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "1994, a professor named Thomas Nicely",
      "duration": 4240,
      "offset": 436880,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "discovered that Intel's Pentium",
      "duration": 3760,
      "offset": 439680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "processor sometimes gave wrong answers",
      "duration": 4560,
      "offset": 441120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "for division. The cause, five entries",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 443440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "were missing from a lookup table in the",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 445680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "chip's floatingoint unit. Just five",
      "duration": 5120,
      "offset": 447440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "values out of over a thousand. Intel had",
      "duration": 7120,
      "offset": 449680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "to recall processors. It cost them 475",
      "duration": 6880,
      "offset": 452560,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "million. At every layer, from punch card",
      "duration": 6239,
      "offset": 456800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "to silicon, humans have made mistakes.",
      "duration": 5520,
      "offset": 459440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "And at every layer, we've built systems",
      "duration": 4401,
      "offset": 463039,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "to catch them, correct them, work around",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 464960,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "them. This is engineering. This is what",
      "duration": 4400,
      "offset": 467440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "we do. But let's go back to the",
      "duration": 3519,
      "offset": 469680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "beginning. Remember when I said",
      "duration": 3120,
      "offset": 471840,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "electrons are probabilistic and then",
      "duration": 4081,
      "offset": 473199,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "that was important. Here's something",
      "duration": 5359,
      "offset": 474960,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "most people don't know. Your computer",
      "duration": 5840,
      "offset": 477280,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "experiences random bit flips. Not from",
      "duration": 6241,
      "offset": 480319,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "software bugs, but from cosmic rays.",
      "duration": 6079,
      "offset": 483120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "High energy particles from space collide",
      "duration": 4960,
      "offset": 486560,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "with atoms in the atmosphere, creating",
      "duration": 4961,
      "offset": 489199,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "showers of secondary particles. Some of",
      "duration": 4880,
      "offset": 491520,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "those particles hit your RAM. When they",
      "duration": 4800,
      "offset": 494160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "do, they can flip a bit. A zero becomes",
      "duration": 7120,
      "offset": 496400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "a one. A one becomes a zero. In 2003, an",
      "duration": 7519,
      "offset": 498960,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "electron in Sharik, Belgium, gave one",
      "duration": 6079,
      "offset": 503520,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "candidate exactly 4,96",
      "duration": 7281,
      "offset": 506479,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "extra votes. That's 2 to the 12th power.",
      "duration": 7041,
      "offset": 509599,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "A perfect power of two. The difference",
      "duration": 7120,
      "offset": 513760,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "of exactly one flipped bit. A cosmic ray",
      "duration": 7920,
      "offset": 516640,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "had altered the vote count. In 2013, a",
      "duration": 6880,
      "offset": 520880,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "speedrunner playing Super Mario 64",
      "duration": 6000,
      "offset": 524560,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "watched Mario suddenly teleport through",
      "duration": 5519,
      "offset": 527760,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "the floor. analysis showed a single bit",
      "duration": 7560,
      "offset": 530560,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "had flipped at memory address 05837800,",
      "duration": 4841,
      "offset": 533279,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "changing Mario's vertical position, a",
      "duration": 5039,
      "offset": 538800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "cosmic ray in the middle of a video",
      "duration": 6079,
      "offset": 541200,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "game. IBM estimated in 1996 that a",
      "duration": 6961,
      "offset": 543839,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "desktop computer with 256 MGB of RAM",
      "duration": 6081,
      "offset": 547279,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "would experience about one cosmic ray",
      "duration": 6320,
      "offset": 550800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "bit flip per month. And now we reach the",
      "duration": 6400,
      "offset": 553360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "real foundation. Electrons are not",
      "duration": 5920,
      "offset": 557120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "little balls orbiting a nucleus. In",
      "duration": 6000,
      "offset": 559760,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "fact, they're probability clouds, wave",
      "duration": 4799,
      "offset": 563040,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "functions. You can never know exactly",
      "duration": 3920,
      "offset": 565760,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "where an electron is. You can only know",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 567839,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "the probability of finding it in a",
      "duration": 4480,
      "offset": 569680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "particular location. This isn't",
      "duration": 4401,
      "offset": 571839,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "uncertainty due to our instruments being",
      "duration": 4640,
      "offset": 574160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "imprecise. This is fundamental to",
      "duration": 5440,
      "offset": 576240,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "reality. The electron generally does not",
      "duration": 6080,
      "offset": 578800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "have a definite position until measured.",
      "duration": 6240,
      "offset": 581680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transistors work by controlling the flow",
      "duration": 5360,
      "offset": 584880,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "of these probabilistic particles. When",
      "duration": 4080,
      "offset": 587920,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "you shrink transistors small enough,",
      "duration": 3920,
      "offset": 590240,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "quantum tunneling becomes a problem.",
      "duration": 4240,
      "offset": 592000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Electrons can tunnel through barriers",
      "duration": 4160,
      "offset": 594160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "they shouldn't be able to cross purely",
      "duration": 5279,
      "offset": 596240,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "due to their wavelike nature. The entire",
      "duration": 5280,
      "offset": 598320,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "deterministic computing stack,",
      "duration": 4401,
      "offset": 601519,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "everything from your Python code down to",
      "duration": 5040,
      "offset": 603600,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "the machine instructions, is built on",
      "duration": 5280,
      "offset": 605920,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "particles that are fundamentally",
      "duration": 5680,
      "offset": 608640,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "irreducibly probabilistic.",
      "duration": 6240,
      "offset": 611200,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "So how does it work then? How do we make",
      "duration": 5600,
      "offset": 614320,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "these things work so deterministically?",
      "duration": 4560,
      "offset": 617440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "We engineered our way around it.",
      "duration": 4240,
      "offset": 619920,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transistors are designed with tolerances",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 622000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "and we use enough electrons that the",
      "duration": 3359,
      "offset": 624160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "statistical behavior becomes",
      "duration": 3760,
      "offset": 626000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "predictable. We build error correcting",
      "duration": 4241,
      "offset": 627519,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "memory. We implement check sums and",
      "duration": 5280,
      "offset": 629760,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "parody bits and we create redundancy.",
      "duration": 6240,
      "offset": 631760,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "When a cosmic ray flips a bit in server",
      "duration": 6560,
      "offset": 635040,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "RAM, ECC memory ces it and fixes it. You",
      "duration": 5839,
      "offset": 638000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "never know it happened. The entire",
      "duration": 3760,
      "offset": 641600,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "history of computing is the history of",
      "duration": 3680,
      "offset": 643839,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "taking something unreliable and making",
      "duration": 4080,
      "offset": 645360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "it reliable through architecture,",
      "duration": 3601,
      "offset": 647519,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "through redundancy, through error",
      "duration": 4160,
      "offset": 649440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "handling, hole or no hole in a punch",
      "duration": 5680,
      "offset": 651120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "card, moth in a relay, missing entries",
      "duration": 5600,
      "offset": 653600,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "in lookup tables, cosmic rays flipping",
      "duration": 3920,
      "offset": 656800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "bits, electrons tunneling through",
      "duration": 5360,
      "offset": 659200,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "barriers, every layer uncertainty has",
      "duration": 7920,
      "offset": 660720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "engineering, engineering, engineering.",
      "duration": 5760,
      "offset": 664560,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Which brings us back to where we",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 668640,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "started. I typed write hello world in",
      "duration": 6000,
      "offset": 670320,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Python into AI and it gave me code.",
      "duration": 4800,
      "offset": 673360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "People say AI is different. They say",
      "duration": 3680,
      "offset": 676320,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "it's probabilistic, not deterministic.",
      "duration": 3200,
      "offset": 678160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "They say you can't trust it because it",
      "duration": 2880,
      "offset": 680000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "might give different answers to the same",
      "duration": 3680,
      "offset": 681360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "question. But think about what we just",
      "duration": 4399,
      "offset": 682880,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "walked through. The punch card loom was",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 685040,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "deterministic, but the cards tore and",
      "duration": 3361,
      "offset": 687279,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "the holes were punched wrong. Early",
      "duration": 3359,
      "offset": 689040,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "computers were deterministic, but Moss",
      "duration": 3759,
      "offset": 690640,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "got stuck in relays. The Pentium was",
      "duration": 4081,
      "offset": 692399,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "deterministic, but someone forgot five",
      "duration": 4081,
      "offset": 694399,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "entries in a table. Your RAM is",
      "duration": 5039,
      "offset": 696480,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "deterministic, but cosmic rays flip bits",
      "duration": 5280,
      "offset": 698480,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "anyway. Electrons are fundamentally",
      "duration": 4880,
      "offset": 701519,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "probabilistic. Yet, we engineered our",
      "duration": 5199,
      "offset": 703760,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "way around that, too. Every layer",
      "duration": 6000,
      "offset": 706399,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "started with unreliability. Every layer",
      "duration": 6081,
      "offset": 708959,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "becomes reliable through architecture.",
      "duration": 6081,
      "offset": 712399,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "AI is no different. It's just the new",
      "duration": 6000,
      "offset": 715040,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "layer. Right now, we're in the era of",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 718480,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "moths in relays. We're finding the",
      "duration": 4320,
      "offset": 721040,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "errors. We're tapping them into log",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 723200,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "books. We're building systems to catch",
      "duration": 3760,
      "offset": 725360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "mistakes and verify outputs or just",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 727200,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "create redundancy. The criticism that AI",
      "duration": 4719,
      "offset": 729120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "is merely probabilistic misses the point",
      "duration": 3599,
      "offset": 731920,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "entirely. The critics aren't thinking",
      "duration": 3521,
      "offset": 733839,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "about the full stack. They're not seeing",
      "duration": 3440,
      "offset": 735519,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "that everything beneath their feet is",
      "duration": 3760,
      "offset": 737360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "probabistic, too. We just did the",
      "duration": 4961,
      "offset": 738959,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "engineering work already. When you type",
      "duration": 4880,
      "offset": 741120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "print hello, you're not just running one",
      "duration": 4560,
      "offset": 743920,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "line of code. You're invoking decades of",
      "duration": 5040,
      "offset": 746000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "accumulated engineering. Thousands of",
      "duration": 5840,
      "offset": 748480,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "people who solved thousands of problems.",
      "duration": 5520,
      "offset": 751040,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "error handlers built on error handlers",
      "duration": 4800,
      "offset": 754320,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "all the way down to the quantum phone.",
      "duration": 5279,
      "offset": 756560,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lovely saw it. The loom weaves the",
      "duration": 4719,
      "offset": 759120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "patterns. The engine weaves the algebra.",
      "duration": 4881,
      "offset": 761839,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "The computer weaves the logic. And now",
      "duration": 6321,
      "offset": 763839,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "AI weaves the language. Same pattern,",
      "duration": 6960,
      "offset": 766720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "different layer. The only question is",
      "duration": 5840,
      "offset": 770160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "how long it takes us to build the",
      "duration": 4959,
      "offset": 773680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "architecture that makes it reliable. And",
      "duration": 4880,
      "offset": 776000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "based on history, I'm pretty sure we're",
      "duration": 4081,
      "offset": 778639,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "going to figure it out. I mean, we",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 780880,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "always do.",
      "duration": 3760,
      "offset": 782720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "But that brings us all the way back to",
      "duration": 5280,
      "offset": 784880,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "the beginning. That one line of Python,",
      "duration": 6640,
      "offset": 786480,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "22 characters built on the shoulders of",
      "duration": 5760,
      "offset": 790160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "every engineer who ever taped a moth",
      "duration": 5360,
      "offset": 793120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "into a log book. Stay curious, my",
      "duration": 7800,
      "offset": 795920,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "friends, and until next time, goodbye.",
      "duration": 5240,
      "offset": 798480,
      "lang": "en"
    }
  ]
}